  "sourceText": "Almost Snickers\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, February 17, 2010 - 11:49pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n12 ounces Low fat ice cream, softened\n1 cup Low fat Cool Whip\n1/4 cup Crunchy peanut butter\n1 pkt Sugar free Chocolate pudding\n3 ounces Grape Nut cereal\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix together ice cream, Cool Whip, peanut butter and pudding. Fold in Grape Nuts. Spread in 8x8 inch pan and freeze.",
